## set_strategy
Set AI strategy for scope country  
set_strategy = <key>
**Value Type**: common/ai_strategies  
**Supported Scopes**: country  

## set_subsidized
Sets whether a building is subsidized  
set_subsidized = yes/no
**Supported Scopes**: building  

## set_suppression
Starts/stops suppressing the political movement in scope  
set_suppression = yes/no
